          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Tekton lists chromium-vanadium grades (50BV30 and 6140) for its chrome hand sockets. Its impact sockets mostly use 50BV30 chromium-vanadium, with 4140 chromium-molybdenum for the largest sizes in some sets, finished in manganese phosphate. Heat treatment, wall thickness and finish are what make them suitable for impact use."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
