          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It is a 1/2-inch drive click-type torque wrench with a 10 to 150 ft-lb range. Tekton calls it a micrometer torque wrench, the manual gives plus or minus 4 percent accuracy, and Tekton's site now lists it as no longer available. It is often searched alongside sockets because it pairs with 1/2-inch sockets for lug nuts."
