          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A 3/8-inch drive set with shallow and deep sockets in SAE and metric covers most car and household work. Add 1/4-inch drive for small fasteners and 1/2-inch for suspension and lug nuts. If you use an impact wrench, buy a separate impact set rather than using chrome sockets on it."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do Tekton sockets have a lifetime warranty?",
